        "b": 256.8513200000001
      },
      "content": "NOTICE:",
      "level": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1135",
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1135",
          "title": "NOTICE:"
        }
      ],
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "page": 65,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0991",
      "reading_order": 1136,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.99921,
        "t": 254.29133000000013,
        "r": 556.4092100000004,
        "b": 219.05136000000016
      },
      "content": "Never mix greases of different consistencies (NLGI 1 or 3 with NLGI 2) or with different thickeners. For example, never mix a lithium-based grease with a polyurea-based grease. Doing so may result in decreased performance.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1135",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1135",
          "title": "NOTICE:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 65,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0992",
      "reading_order": 1137,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.9992,
        "t": 216.4913700000002,
        "r": 546.8592000000003,
        "b": 193.25137000000018
      },
      "content": "Remove the bearings and old grease if you need to change the grease type or consistency. Failure to do so may result in equipment damage or decreased performance.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1135",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1135",
          "title": "NOTICE:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 65,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0993",
      "reading_order": 1138,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99915,
        "t": 165.9713599999999,
        "r": 517.9191500000002,
        "b": 144.73135999999988
      },
      "content": "Bearing temperatures are generally about 20°F (18°C) greater than bearing-housing outer surface temperatures.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1135",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1135",
          "title": "NOTICE:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 65,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0994",
      "reading_order": 1139,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99915,
        "t": 142.9713599999999,
        "r": 486.88915000000026,
        "b": 131.73135999999988
      },
      "content": "This table shows the type of  grease required for the operating temperature of  the pump.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1135",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1135",
          "title": "NOTICE:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 65,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
