      },
      "markdown": "| Bearing temperature           | Type of grease                                                       |\n|-------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| 5°F to 230°F (-15°C to 110°C) | Use a lithium-based mineral-oil grease with a consistency of NLGI 2. |",
